	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1"><persName ref="p8502" cert="high">Sellarius</persName> bezieht sich auf die Antwort <persName ref="p495" cert="high">Bullingers</persName> auf sein Schreiben vom 20. September des Vorjahres (<bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl>, <ref target="file10937">Nr. 895</ref>).</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Dici non potest, quantum me tua <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>epistola<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Nicht erhalten.</note> exhilararit, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> doctissime.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cognovi enim in ea facilitatem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>atque humanitatem, quas passim scriptis praedicas, factis quoque et vita <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>docere, id quod in paucis iam videmus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Expertus enim sum fastum illum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Luthericum in persecutione <persName ref="p4349">Carolstadiana</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Gemeint ist die Verfolgung, die sich gegen <persName ref="p4349">Karlstadt</persName> und seine Anhänger richtete.</note>, qui hodie adhuc durat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Soli <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sibi isti homines videntur sapere, atque utinam ad dei gloriam et proximi <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>salutem sapiant!</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Gratias vero tibi ago quantum possum maximas, quod <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>me, hominem infimae conditionis, tuis literis compellare non dedigneris.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Orabo dominum, ut eam tibi mentem potius augeat quam minuat, ut iam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>fere nostra culpa fieri animadvertimus, quo tandem magni illi (ut de se, quan<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tum apparet, sibiipsis pollicentur), qui vos quasi haereticos reputant, victi et <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>in sua conscientia pudefacti ad sese redeant praemeditatiusque agant et scribant.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Nam vere, ut scribis, fastus dominatur apud plerosque, non humilitas.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Passim <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quoque apud nos illorum causa verbum domini male ab adversariis audit, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quamvis se quoque hi gravi censura dignos fateantur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ac nimium vereor - <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>avertat dominus omen infaustum -, ne plaga dei gravis hanc ingentem <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nostram ingratitudinem ulciscatur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Apud vos vero antiqua illa synceritas <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et humanitas colitur, ut audio, quod summe gratulor, esse locum, ubi verum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ametur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Undecimum caput ad Corinthios in tuo opere<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Die im März 1537 erschienene Gesamtausgabe von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Kommentaren zu den Paulusbriefen [<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 84] enthält eine überarbeitete Auslegung von <cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 11, 17-34</ref></cit>; s. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10914">[Nr. 874]</ref>, S. 382, Anm. 5.</note> bis terque relegi et <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Dialogum quoque piae memoriae <persName ref="p2442">Oecolampadii</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p2442">Oekolampads</persName> "Quid de eucharistia veteres ... senserint, dialogus" (<persName ref="p2442">Oekolampad</persName>-Bibliographie 78, Nr. 164) ist abgedruckt in der 1536 erschienenen Sammlung von Briefen <persName ref="p2442">Oekolampads</persName> und <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglis</persName> (<persName ref="p2442">Oekolampad</persName>-Bibliographie 88f, Nr. 182).</note>, qui adhuc immotus stat manebitque<pb type="edition" next="122"/> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>apud syncerioris iudicii viros.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Spernat <persName ref="p2095">Philippus</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p2095">Melanchthon</persName>.</note>, quantum velit; quo solo, ut <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mihi videtur, repugnat.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Fortassis tot clarissimos veterum autorum locos se <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>reiicere non posse vident eamque ob rem scriptis abstinent, nisi quantum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>sparsim in libris alio sub titulo editis clanculum mordent.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Det illis <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>deus mentem saniorem et vobis in bono perseverantiam<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. z. B. <persName ref="p18700">Augustin</persName>, De correptione et gratia, 6, 10 (<bibl source="b446">MPL</bibl> XLIV 921-923).</note>!</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sola haec de <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>coena sententia mea in causa est, quod ex hoc pistrino uxoris <persName ref="p6619">frater</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p6619">Bleikard Sindringer</persName>; vgl. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10937">[Nr. 895]</ref>, S. 428f, 9-26.</note> me non <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>eripit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Neque ego conditionem splendidam, sed in abdito mihi et literis vi-<pb type="scan" next="||497v."/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>vere cupio, sicubi dominus offerat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Interim labore hoc contentus vivam, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quousque dominus aliam humeris provinciam imponat, et legendis quae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>habeo bibliis et tuis opusculis, quando otium suppeditatur, me oblectabo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Maiora illa opera <persName ref="p8127">Pellicani</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Gemeint sind <persName ref="p8127">Pellikans</persName> Bibelkommentare, von denen zu diesem Zeitpunkt bereits sechs Teile erschienen waren (<bibl>BZD</bibl> C 217, C 256f, C 266).</note> emere penuria prohibet, adversa nimis dea<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. Adagia, 1, 1, 42 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 44).</note>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Et satis ex tuis, <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglii</persName> et <persName ref="p2442">Oecolampadii</persName> scriptis sententiam eam <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>edoctus sum dei gratia, quem precor, ut te et quotquot apud vos et <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ubique terrarum sunt, qui syncero animo patris et Christi gloriam quaerunt, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>confortet, quo citra omnem timorem constanter et doceant et <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>vivant.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Multi enim iam sunt, quibus Iacobus merito dicat: "Tu fidem <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>habes, et ego facta habeo" <cit type="bible"><ref>[Jak 2, 18]</ref></cit>, quos dominus illuminet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Haec quasi deplorans <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>nostra tempora infoelicia ad te animo candido scripsi.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Nosti enim, quemad<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>modum pleraque pars evangelium prae se ferentium concionatorum sese <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>gerat et quid quaerat.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tu, quaeso, boni consulas haec mea scripta, nam <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>tua bonitate fretus prolixius scripsi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l157">Francofordiae</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>4. calendas aprileis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Tui studiosissimus</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/><persName ref="p8502">Henrichus Sellarius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf f. 497a v.:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Pietatis preconi insigni domino <persName ref="p495">Henricho <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, pastori <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> diligentissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>suo plurimum colendo, salutem.</s>
				</p>
